---
// Chinmaya Jnanashakti Section for Homepage
// Displays the sacred mission to welcome Sri Dandayudhapani
---

<section id="jnanashakti" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-burgundy-50 via-indigo-50 to-blue-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-4">
        Chinmaya Jnanashakti
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-burgundy-800 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-serif italic">
        The Staff of Wisdom. The Anchor of our Lives.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-16">
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-6">
          Welcoming Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani
        </h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 mb-6">
          For years, our community has flourished under the guidance of Vedantic wisdom. Yet, a home is incomplete without its presiding deity—the source of Shakti that fuels our spiritual journey.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 mb-8">
          Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani represents the power of knowledge and the strength of discipline. His permanent installation at our temple will anchor our hearts and inspire seekers to pursue wisdom and righteous living.
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-maroon-50 rounded-lg p-6 border-2 border-burgundy-300 mb-8">
          <p class="text-burgundy-900 font-serif italic text-lg">
            "His home is being built. His pedestal is being prepared. Your hands will make it possible."
          </p>
        </div>

        <a 
          href="/jnanashakti"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-600 to-burgundy-600 hover:from-burgundy-700 hover:to-burgundy-700 text-white font-serif font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition shadow-lg"
        >
          Learn More
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.293 14.707a1 1 0 010-1.414L10.586 10 7.293 6.707a1 1 0 011.414-1.414l4 4a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Element -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="w-full max-w-sm">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-burgundy-200 to-burgundy-200 rounded-lg p-8 aspect-square flex items-center justify-center text-center">
            <div>
              <div class="text-6xl mb-4">🔱</div>
              <p class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-2">
                Coming Home
              </p>
              <p class="text-burgundy-800">
                His sacred installation (Murti Sthaapana) at our temple
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Two Aspects of Dandayudhapani -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
      <div class="bg-maroon-50 rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 border-l-4 border-burgundy-600">
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl mr-4">📚</span>
          Jnana - Knowledge
        </h4>
        <p class="text-maroon-800">
          The power of divine wisdom and spiritual understanding that illuminates the path to enlightenment and liberates the soul from ignorance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-maroon-50 rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 border-l-4 border-burgundy-600">
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
          <span class="text-3xl mr-4">💪</span>
          Danda - Discipline
        </h4>
        <p class="text-maroon-800">
          The strength and determination to walk the righteous path with unwavering resolve, maintaining spiritual discipline and moral excellence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Sponsorship Tiers Preview -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-8 text-center">
        Be a Pillar of Support
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 text-center mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Every contribution is sacred. Choose your role in welcoming Sri Dandayudhapani to His permanent home.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Tier 1 -->
        <div class="bg-maroon-50 rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 border-2 border-burgundy-300 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <p class="text-burgundy-900 font-semibold mb-1">GRAND PATRON</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-burgundy-600 mb-3">$25,000+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-maroon-700 mb-4">The Foundation Bearer • Permanent Donor Wall recognition</p>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-purple-600 text-white hover:bg-purple-700 font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded transition text-sm"
          >
            Sponsor
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2 -->
        <div class="bg-maroon-50 rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 border-2 border-burgundy-300 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <p class="text-burgundy-900 font-semibold mb-1">THE DANDA PATRON</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-burgundy-600 mb-3">$10,000+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-maroon-700 mb-4">Strength of the Mission • Special ceremony role</p>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-burgundy-600 text-white hover:bg-burgundy-700 font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded transition text-sm"
          >
            Sponsor
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3 -->
        <div class="bg-maroon-50 rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 border-2 border-blue-300 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <p class="text-blue-900 font-semibold mb-1">MAYURA SPONSOR</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-3">$5,000</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-maroon-700 mb-4">Rituals & Adornments • Donor Wall recognition</p>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700 font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded transition text-sm"
          >
            Sponsor
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-8">
        <p class="text-maroon-800 mb-4">
          Additional sponsorship levels available at $2,500, $1,008, and $108
        </p>
        <a 
          href="/jnanashakti"
          class="inline-flex items-center text-burgundy-600 hover:text-burgundy-800 font-semibold"
        >
          View all sponsorship options →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-600 to-burgundy-600 text-white rounded-lg p-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-lg mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        "We are building a home for the One who holds us up." Open your heart and join this sacred mission.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
        target="_blank"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-maroon-50 text-burgundy-700 hover:bg-purple-50 font-serif font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition shadow-lg"
      >
        Build His Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
